WEBVTT

01:30.840 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:37.900
[Episode 31]

01:37.950 --> 01:39.000
My dear nephew.

01:39.509 --> 01:40.830
Everyone already thinks

01:40.830 --> 01:42.900
I've made a fortune here.

01:43.229 --> 01:44.450
If I go and personally decide

01:44.450 --> 01:45.560
to hand over the Lianghuai salt industry

01:45.560 --> 01:46.840
to your family,

01:47.680 --> 01:49.460
the memorials impeaching me

01:49.680 --> 01:52.140
would pile up even higher than
the city wall.

01:54.870 --> 01:57.229
However, if you render some merit,

01:57.789 --> 02:00.350
then others won't have anything
to hold against you.

02:00.350 --> 02:01.280
Don't you agree?

02:01.310 --> 02:01.910
Am I right?

02:05.070 --> 02:06.810
That's one way to look at it.

02:07.920 --> 02:09.120
But why did you involve

02:09.120 --> 02:10.280
Gu Pingyuan in this?

02:10.520 --> 02:11.720
What if he wins?

02:11.840 --> 02:12.820
What then?

02:14.310 --> 02:15.560
Mr. Gu represents

02:15.600 --> 02:17.710
the small merchants
among the common people.

02:17.710 --> 02:19.200
If Mr. Gu wins,

02:19.470 --> 02:20.840
then the salt industry in Jiangnan

02:20.840 --> 02:22.030
can no longer be dictated solely

02:22.030 --> 02:23.360
by your Li family.

02:23.710 --> 02:25.370
You'll have to leave some room

02:25.400 --> 02:27.730
for the merchants of Jiangnan to survive.

02:27.840 --> 02:29.700
If your family takes everything,

02:30.520 --> 02:33.060
it wouldn't look good for me

02:33.120 --> 02:34.360
as the Viceroy of Liangjiang

02:34.360 --> 02:36.020
to do nothing about it, right?

02:36.710 --> 02:38.240
Sir, I have one more matter.

02:38.710 --> 02:39.680
If this coastal embankment

02:39.680 --> 02:41.540
were to be funded by our Li family,

02:41.630 --> 02:42.470
all expenses

02:42.710 --> 02:45.110
would naturally be covered entirely by us.

02:45.150 --> 02:46.520
But how should Mr. Gu's share

02:46.520 --> 02:47.850
of the costs be handled?

02:50.150 --> 02:53.120
Of course we'll wait for
the imperial court's approval.

02:53.120 --> 02:55.000
Court approval? I'm afraid that
even if we wait until next year

02:55.000 --> 02:58.430
when the floods come again,
the funds still won't be released.

02:58.430 --> 02:59.960
I understand what you mean, Sir.

02:59.960 --> 03:01.130
I dare not delay.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.710
I'll go to Nantong right away

03:02.710 --> 03:04.400
to inspect the damage to
the coastal embankment

03:04.400 --> 03:05.260
and make a plan.

03:05.430 --> 03:06.290
I take my leave.

03:06.470 --> 03:08.110
Please proceed, my dear nephew.

03:08.110 --> 03:09.620
I'll thank you in advance

03:09.680 --> 03:11.610
on behalf of the people of Nantong.

03:15.590 --> 03:16.190
Mr. Gu,

03:16.960 --> 03:18.360
did I say you could leave?

03:19.710 --> 03:21.079
But I need to go to Nantong
for the field inspection.

03:21.079 --> 03:22.270
Don't make excuses.

03:22.560 --> 03:23.870
The moment you two walk out of this door,

03:23.870 --> 03:26.150
you'll definitely start calling me names.

03:26.150 --> 03:27.079
Come on, inside.

03:27.840 --> 03:30.560
I'll give you the money for
the coastal embankment repairs.

03:30.560 --> 03:31.870
I've already mortgaged

03:31.870 --> 03:33.530
all my properties in Beijing.

03:33.630 --> 03:35.800
We may not be as rich as the Li family,

03:36.630 --> 03:37.910
but you must remember:

03:38.840 --> 03:41.000
the money you're receiving is clean,

03:41.590 --> 03:44.120
and you must make sure
its use is clean as well.

03:47.840 --> 03:48.520
This...

03:49.840 --> 03:50.910
Li Qin is right.

03:51.750 --> 03:53.750
Even when it floods again next year,

03:53.750 --> 03:56.410
the imperial court's money
still won't arrive.

03:56.560 --> 03:59.000
But the common people
can't wait that long.

04:00.910 --> 04:02.310
I won't let you down, Sir.

04:03.030 --> 04:03.830
Remember this

04:04.310 --> 04:05.150
about me:

04:05.190 --> 04:06.520
I've been simple-minded my whole life,

04:06.520 --> 04:08.310
and my learning and literacy
have never matched others.

04:08.310 --> 04:09.520
But there's one thing—

04:09.520 --> 04:11.280
I take one step at a time,

04:11.750 --> 04:12.840
neither deceiving myself

04:12.840 --> 04:13.590
nor others,

04:13.960 --> 04:16.680
and once I set out to do something,
I see it through.

04:16.680 --> 04:19.000
If you rush and push for progress,

04:19.800 --> 04:21.800
it will only lead to grave mistakes.

04:44.020 --> 04:46.120
Are you inspecting the coastal embankment
or racing horses?

04:46.120 --> 04:48.190
The more I think about it,
the angrier I get.

04:48.190 --> 04:49.040
That old man is now

04:49.040 --> 04:51.040
treating us like three-year-olds.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.070
He's already started

04:52.070 --> 04:54.130
sowing discord between us in public.

04:55.780 --> 04:57.000
Here's what I thought.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.040
After I left just now,

04:58.040 --> 05:00.870
he definitely started muttering about me
behind my back again, right?

05:00.870 --> 05:01.920
Didn't you ask him for me

05:01.920 --> 05:02.830
why he wouldn't help me

05:02.830 --> 05:04.120
with the salt field matter?

05:04.120 --> 05:04.720
I did.

05:04.950 --> 05:05.630
He said your family

05:05.630 --> 05:07.270
was just taking advantage of
others' misfortune.

05:07.270 --> 05:08.390
Taking advantage of others' misfortune?

05:08.390 --> 05:09.030
Nonsense.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.800
Merchants buy low and sell high.

05:11.830 --> 05:12.580
This has been

05:12.680 --> 05:13.630
the natural order of things
since ancient times.

05:13.630 --> 05:15.070
If I preach morality to them every day,

05:15.070 --> 05:16.870
I'll be left with nothing to eat.

05:17.600 --> 05:19.140
Let's go check the coastal embankment.

05:19.140 --> 05:21.070
This matter is quite troublesome.

05:24.020 --> 05:24.560
Gu,

05:25.310 --> 05:26.460
give me your word first

05:26.460 --> 05:27.590
so I can feel at ease.

05:27.830 --> 05:28.480
Go ahead.

05:28.830 --> 05:30.310
My father asked me to handle

05:30.310 --> 05:31.360
the salt field matter in Lianghuai.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.470
This is my only chance

05:32.470 --> 05:33.800
to make something of myself.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.060
So I've been thinking,

05:35.230 --> 05:36.560
no matter what it costs,

05:37.190 --> 05:37.850
I have to win

05:38.000 --> 05:39.000
and get this done.

05:39.390 --> 05:41.050
Could you give me some leeway?

05:41.630 --> 05:43.310
It's not a matter of giving you leeway.

05:43.310 --> 05:43.920
Well,

05:43.950 --> 05:45.390
I've never done
any salt field business before, either.

05:45.390 --> 05:46.380
But as you said,

05:46.430 --> 05:48.030
we're not three-year-olds.

05:48.190 --> 05:48.870
He wants to trap us

05:48.870 --> 05:49.950
in a chicken coop,

05:50.870 --> 05:51.830
but we

05:51.870 --> 05:53.000
can't just let him manipulate us,

05:53.000 --> 05:53.480
right?

05:54.920 --> 05:56.580
Then let's settle it this way:

05:56.600 --> 05:57.840
for the height of the coastal embankment,

05:57.840 --> 05:59.240
give me some concession.

05:59.430 --> 06:00.600
The imperial court's standard

06:00.600 --> 06:01.360
is 11 meters.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.510
I'll raise it by

06:02.560 --> 06:03.360
an extra 3.3 meters on top of that.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.380
Is that acceptable?

06:04.380 --> 06:05.600
I'll thank you in advance

06:05.600 --> 06:07.800
on behalf of the people of Nantong then.

06:13.750 --> 06:14.830
I am Gu Pingyuan.

06:15.190 --> 06:17.660
I am Li Qin, candidate intendant
of Jiangning.

06:17.660 --> 06:19.030
[Marshal]

06:18.800 --> 06:19.560
Come on in.

06:21.470 --> 06:24.150
[Marshal]

06:28.750 --> 06:29.480
Marshal Jiu.

06:30.000 --> 06:30.730
Marshal Jiu.

06:44.120 --> 06:45.750
Whenever it's time to pay the troops,

06:45.750 --> 06:46.720
I get anxious.

06:51.159 --> 06:51.830
You two

06:52.560 --> 06:54.090
seem to have much free time.

06:54.430 --> 06:55.159
Marshal Jiu.

06:55.800 --> 06:57.190
The Viceroy of Liangjiang has tasked us

06:57.190 --> 06:59.000
with repairing the coastal embankment
in Nantong,

06:59.000 --> 07:00.800
but now Nantong is nearly deserted.

07:00.800 --> 07:02.480
We can't even gather enough workers,

07:02.480 --> 07:04.360
so we've come specifically to trouble you,
Marshal Jiu,

07:04.360 --> 07:06.160
hoping to borrow some manpower.

07:06.560 --> 07:08.390
Well, we won't be using your soldiers

07:08.390 --> 07:09.120
for free.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.750
Stonemasons and carpenters
will be paid

07:11.750 --> 07:12.960
300 maces per day,

07:13.190 --> 07:15.160
and laborers 150 per day.

07:15.310 --> 07:17.460
Paid daily for work completed,

07:17.620 --> 07:19.950
with meals and lodging
provided on-site.

07:20.000 --> 07:20.660
Borrow soldiers?

07:20.660 --> 07:22.070
Come on, just take them away.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.400
Take as many as you need.

07:23.840 --> 07:24.900
That's excellent!

07:30.630 --> 07:31.560
I've been worried about

07:31.560 --> 07:33.960
owing my soldiers' pay
for over half a year.

07:35.560 --> 07:37.750
They've been grumbling every day,

07:37.800 --> 07:39.659
on the verge of mutiny against me.

07:40.680 --> 07:42.480
If you can take them off my hands,

07:42.950 --> 07:45.250
I'll thank you both eternally.

07:45.720 --> 07:46.360
Please.

07:47.510 --> 07:49.560
That's not what His Excellency said.

07:49.560 --> 07:50.950
He told us that
if we ran into manpower problems,

07:50.950 --> 07:52.150
we should come to you.

07:54.510 --> 07:56.170
I'm in urgent need of money now

07:57.070 --> 07:58.670
so I can dismiss them quickly

07:59.120 --> 08:00.920
before they cause trouble here.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.820
Do you still dare to take them?

08:07.510 --> 08:08.120
But...

08:08.920 --> 08:09.360
Sir.

08:09.680 --> 08:11.390
Then what do you suggest we do?

08:11.480 --> 08:13.610
This isn't something money can solve.

08:13.680 --> 08:14.750
If once the work starts,

08:14.750 --> 08:15.720
the schedule is delayed

08:15.720 --> 08:17.070
due to a shortage of manpower,

08:17.070 --> 08:18.310
-then how should we...
-Getting impatient?

08:18.310 --> 08:19.120
Don't be.

08:22.630 --> 08:24.290
That old man sent you to see me—

08:25.310 --> 08:26.840
of course I have a solution.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.250
I knew

08:29.510 --> 08:31.360
Marshal Jiu must have a brilliant plan.

08:31.360 --> 08:32.090
Marshal Jiu.

08:32.390 --> 08:33.320
Stop teasing us

08:33.549 --> 08:34.950
and just tell us already.

08:35.730 --> 08:36.669
The Governor's office

08:36.669 --> 08:37.640
is holding

08:37.669 --> 08:38.909
5 to 6 thousand old rebels

08:38.909 --> 08:40.510
captured when Nanjing fell.

08:40.720 --> 08:42.789
You only need to provide meals for them—

08:42.789 --> 08:44.010
no need to pay them.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.840
I'll assign you two units

08:46.000 --> 08:47.000
to watch over them

08:47.080 --> 08:49.010
while they work on the embankment.

08:49.200 --> 08:50.000
But of course,

08:50.240 --> 08:51.240
the soldiers' pay

08:51.400 --> 08:53.060
will have to be covered by you.

08:54.730 --> 08:58.950
[Nantong Coastal Embankment
Construction Site]

09:00.390 --> 09:01.150
One, two!

09:02.270 --> 09:03.120
One, two!

09:04.240 --> 09:05.080
One, two!

09:07.240 --> 09:08.080
One, two!

09:09.200 --> 09:10.000
One, two!

09:16.070 --> 09:16.630
One, two!

09:17.750 --> 09:18.600
One, two!

09:32.030 --> 09:34.550
These are all good stones
from Wolf Hill.

09:33.820 --> 09:37.070
[Su Yuhua, Nantong Prefecture Magistrate]

09:35.240 --> 09:37.480
Mr. Gu, you're really something.

09:37.910 --> 09:38.840
Since we're repairing it,

09:38.840 --> 09:40.120
we might as well do it properly.

09:40.120 --> 09:42.630
Let's make sure it won't collapse
for 100 years.

09:42.630 --> 09:43.940
I also went to check

09:44.030 --> 09:45.220
the West Coastal Embankment.

09:45.220 --> 09:46.290
Mr. Li Qin

09:46.360 --> 09:48.190
also did a thorough job there.

09:49.790 --> 09:51.010
I made a bet with him.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.310
We're competing to see who repairs faster

09:52.310 --> 09:53.710
and who does a better job.

09:54.230 --> 09:55.180
You know what?

09:55.200 --> 09:57.530
Once our coastal embankment is repaired,

09:57.720 --> 09:58.930
the salt fields in Lianghuai

09:58.930 --> 10:00.300
will be

10:00.330 --> 10:01.660
completely safe.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.870
The people of Nantong
know what's good for them.

10:03.870 --> 10:05.480
Once the rice price stabilizes,

10:05.480 --> 10:06.000
they'll

10:07.120 --> 10:08.750
all come back.

10:26.030 --> 10:26.760
Marshal Jiu.

10:31.480 --> 10:32.630
I've selected over 2,000

10:32.630 --> 10:33.740
able-bodied old rebels

10:33.740 --> 10:35.030
and brought them all over for you.

10:35.030 --> 10:37.230
Now you've got enough manpower, right?

10:37.880 --> 10:38.670
Given their condition,

10:38.670 --> 10:40.080
how are they supposed to work?

10:40.080 --> 10:42.910
With two firearms units assigned,
what's there to worry about?

10:42.910 --> 10:44.840
Just remove their shackles later.

10:45.270 --> 10:46.290
If even one of them escapes,

10:46.290 --> 10:48.220
I can't take that responsibility.

10:51.030 --> 10:53.160
They're all in squads and battalions.

10:53.200 --> 10:55.080
If one person from a squad escapes,

10:55.080 --> 10:56.520
the whole squad will be executed;

10:56.520 --> 10:58.550
if one squad from a battalion escapes,
the entire battalion will be executed.

10:58.550 --> 10:59.670
In broad daylight like this,

10:59.670 --> 11:00.870
who would dare to run?

11:02.150 --> 11:02.780
Unlock the shackles!

11:02.780 --> 11:03.200
Yes.

11:03.670 --> 11:06.440
-Unlock the shackles!
-Unlock the shackles!

11:07.080 --> 11:08.600
I've said all the nice things.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.780
Now for the harsh part.

11:09.780 --> 11:11.310
I don't care if anyone dies,

11:11.600 --> 11:13.600
but if anyone truly dares to escape,

11:14.480 --> 11:16.390
you, Gu, will be considered
aiding the enemy.

11:16.390 --> 11:17.120
I wouldn't dare.

11:17.120 --> 11:18.550
Please rest assured, Marshal Jiu.

11:18.550 --> 11:19.350
You're smart.

11:26.940 --> 11:27.480
Let's go!

11:33.870 --> 11:34.450
Mr. Gu,

11:34.630 --> 11:36.510
please give your instructions.
How do you want us to work?

11:36.510 --> 11:37.850
I have some doctors here
who treat bruises and injuries.

11:37.850 --> 11:38.670
Have the injured

11:38.670 --> 11:39.630
get their wounds treated first.

11:39.630 --> 11:40.500
Those without clothes,

11:40.500 --> 11:41.630
get them dressed.

11:42.030 --> 11:42.690
After they've eaten,

11:42.690 --> 11:44.890
they can start working this afternoon.

11:45.510 --> 11:47.030
No one will actually run away, will they?

11:47.030 --> 11:47.560
Run away?

11:49.240 --> 11:51.170
Can they possibly outrun bullets?

11:53.680 --> 11:57.420
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

11:59.860 --> 12:02.500
[Silence] [Keep Clear]

12:02.590 --> 12:07.950
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

12:15.720 --> 12:16.360
Alright.

12:16.600 --> 12:17.200
Alright.

12:21.040 --> 12:23.610
I'm the imperially appointed
Salt Transport Commissioner of Lianghuai.

12:23.420 --> 12:25.150
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

12:26.240 --> 12:27.630
Well, well, the God of Wealth has arrived.

12:27.630 --> 12:29.480
Pardon me for not welcoming you from afar.

12:29.480 --> 12:30.690
Visitors should pay respects
to seated hosts—

12:30.690 --> 12:32.350
that's the proper etiquette.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.700
Please. Please.

12:33.700 --> 12:34.180
Please.

12:38.150 --> 12:40.370
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

12:41.120 --> 12:42.920
I've long heard that Li Million

12:43.090 --> 12:43.630
donated a position

12:43.630 --> 12:45.750
as the Salt Transport Commissioner
of Lianghuai.

12:45.750 --> 12:47.350
I didn't believe it at first.

12:48.030 --> 12:49.270
Jiangning is a place

12:49.340 --> 12:50.490
full of fiends—

12:50.600 --> 12:52.440
how could anyone make a fortune here?

12:52.440 --> 12:53.870
As the Salt Transport Commissioner
of Lianghuai,

12:53.870 --> 12:55.930
I'm not here to seek ease and comfort.

12:56.670 --> 12:58.200
I'd like to hear about that.

12:59.720 --> 13:02.210
The salt industry of Lianghuai
has always been

13:02.210 --> 13:03.960
an important source of

13:03.980 --> 13:05.440
tax revenue for Jiangnan.

13:05.770 --> 13:07.850
I'm here on His Majesty's decree

13:08.000 --> 13:09.630
to reorganize the salt affairs—

13:09.630 --> 13:10.920
isn't that

13:11.200 --> 13:13.410
exactly what I'm supposed to do?

13:15.240 --> 13:16.550
What salt industry

13:17.150 --> 13:19.100
is even left here in Lianghuai?

13:20.240 --> 13:21.120
Your son has brought

13:21.120 --> 13:23.250
so many title deeds to the salt fields.

13:23.390 --> 13:24.120
It seems to me

13:24.150 --> 13:26.150
that nearly 90% of Lianghuai salt fields

13:26.150 --> 13:26.790
already belong to

13:26.790 --> 13:28.550
you, Li Million.

13:29.030 --> 13:31.080
I think the money you donated
for this position

13:31.080 --> 13:31.740
was a waste.

13:32.110 --> 13:33.710
The Lianghuai salt industry

13:33.830 --> 13:36.160
is already your private property anyway.

13:39.150 --> 13:41.350
I'm here today in my official capacity.

13:42.200 --> 13:43.930
Please do not mention the words

13:44.440 --> 13:47.030
"Li Million" agan, Your Excellency.

13:49.380 --> 13:50.000
Besides,

13:50.390 --> 13:51.120
I'm also here

13:51.910 --> 13:54.120
to help Your Excellency

13:54.150 --> 13:55.750
solve your problems.

13:57.750 --> 13:59.270
What problems do I have?

13:59.510 --> 14:01.510
Aren't your problems significant?

14:02.750 --> 14:04.600
Nanjing is like a powder keg.

14:05.480 --> 14:06.790
Zeng Xiangxiang's troops

14:06.790 --> 14:08.720
are not the imperial court's army.

14:09.390 --> 14:11.360
How many people have they killed
over the past decade?

14:11.360 --> 14:13.550
Who among them is a law-abiding citizen?

14:13.550 --> 14:15.720
If they start causing trouble,

14:15.840 --> 14:17.630
Jiangnan will fall again.

14:18.370 --> 14:20.300
Which army from the imperial court

14:20.750 --> 14:22.350
could possibly subdue them?

14:23.270 --> 14:24.730
That's the first problem.

14:25.240 --> 14:25.910
Second,

14:27.080 --> 14:28.670
how long have the officials in Lianghuai

14:28.670 --> 14:29.750
gone without their salaries?

14:29.750 --> 14:31.280
After 10 years of war,

14:31.440 --> 14:33.390
military merits have been
handed out recklessly.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.440
The officers standing guard

14:34.440 --> 14:35.480
at Your Excellency's gate

14:35.480 --> 14:37.280
are all second-rank officials.

14:37.360 --> 14:39.000
If they start causing trouble,

14:39.000 --> 14:40.060
what would happen?

14:40.200 --> 14:42.030
The coastal embankment in Nantong
is in disrepair,

14:42.030 --> 14:43.390
and the 7 subordinate counties
under Nantong

14:43.390 --> 14:44.720
are full of disaster-stricken people,

14:44.720 --> 14:47.320
with innumerable roads
and houses destroyed.

14:47.720 --> 14:48.380
Officials,

14:48.720 --> 14:49.380
civilians,

14:49.550 --> 14:50.120
soldiers—

14:50.120 --> 14:51.120
none are at peace.

14:52.550 --> 14:53.630
Yet Your Excellency sits here

14:53.630 --> 14:54.510
so comfortably,

14:54.510 --> 14:56.480
telling me everything is fine.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.510
Let me say it again.

15:01.270 --> 15:01.960
I'm here

15:02.390 --> 15:04.520
to ease your burden, Your Excellency,

15:05.550 --> 15:07.120
not to cause trouble.

15:12.850 --> 15:13.700
Look at you.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.340
When did I ever say

15:15.480 --> 15:16.390
that you're here

15:16.390 --> 15:17.910
to make trouble?

15:19.480 --> 15:20.200
My situation here

15:20.200 --> 15:22.130
is indeed in shambles.

15:23.030 --> 15:25.030
As for the coastal embankment
in disrepair in Nantong,

15:25.030 --> 15:27.480
your esteemed son has bravely
taken on this immense responsibility

15:27.480 --> 15:29.320
and has already gone to the site
for inspection.

15:29.320 --> 15:29.910
He's even planning to pay

15:29.910 --> 15:31.980
out of his own pocket for the repairs.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.670
I've already submitted the memorial

15:33.670 --> 15:35.530
recommending him for this merit.

15:39.120 --> 15:40.000
You may be able to fool him,

15:40.000 --> 15:41.150
but not me.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.910
He's not an official.

15:44.390 --> 15:46.720
Even if a memorial for merit is submitted,

15:46.840 --> 15:48.440
he won't receive any reward.

15:48.480 --> 15:49.390
Your Excellency's aim

15:49.390 --> 15:51.240
in draining his money

15:51.270 --> 15:53.270
was to lure me out—

15:54.270 --> 15:55.080
and here I am.

15:56.760 --> 15:57.960
Confucius once said,

15:58.080 --> 15:59.670
"to speak to those who cannot respond

15:59.670 --> 16:00.870
is a mistake of words;

16:01.270 --> 16:03.430
to remain silent
before those who can respond

16:03.430 --> 16:04.890
is a mistake of judgment."

16:05.750 --> 16:06.750
Your Excellency,

16:07.910 --> 16:11.630
which mistake do you plan to make?

16:19.510 --> 16:21.030
You, oh you.

16:21.910 --> 16:22.790
Li Million,

16:23.150 --> 16:24.950
you're still the same as always.

16:26.470 --> 16:27.270
Alright then.

16:27.440 --> 16:29.910
Let's be frank and open with each other.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.960
All the revenue
from the Lianghuai salt fields

16:31.960 --> 16:33.670
has been going to your Li family,

16:33.670 --> 16:35.930
leaving the Jiangnan region lifeless.

16:36.670 --> 16:38.530
At the very least, show some mercy

16:38.790 --> 16:40.850
and leave a little for the local area.

16:41.750 --> 16:44.550
The money made in Lianghuai
should be used in Lianghuai.

16:44.550 --> 16:45.550
Your Excellency,

16:45.960 --> 16:47.840
please do not interfere.

16:50.600 --> 16:52.220
Before leaving the capital,

16:52.440 --> 16:53.970
His Highness instructed me

16:55.150 --> 16:56.910
that as long as you can ensure this area

16:56.910 --> 16:58.730
remains peaceful for 3 years,

16:59.270 --> 17:00.320
he'll find a way

17:00.750 --> 17:03.350
to get you to the capital
to enjoy a life of ease.

17:04.069 --> 17:05.140
Don't get involved

17:06.440 --> 17:08.300
in the salt field matter anymore.

17:33.510 --> 17:34.720
Eat slowly.

17:34.790 --> 17:36.190
Don't bite your fingers.

17:37.720 --> 17:38.890
Look at you,

17:38.920 --> 17:39.870
so busy every day.

17:39.870 --> 17:41.030
We barely even see you.

17:41.030 --> 17:42.200
You don't know the whole story.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.640
The coastal embankment in Nantong

17:43.640 --> 17:44.750
has been washed away,

17:44.750 --> 17:45.750
and the entire land

17:45.750 --> 17:47.070
has been flooded by seawater.

17:47.070 --> 17:48.890
The common people are fleeing everywhere

17:48.890 --> 17:50.020
with nothing to eat.

17:53.240 --> 17:54.200
When we first heard

17:54.200 --> 17:55.710
you were going to Nantong,

17:55.880 --> 17:57.920
Yu'er and I were actually happy about it.

17:57.920 --> 18:00.050
Who would have imagined such a big city

18:00.270 --> 18:02.330
would end up in such a terrible state?

18:04.160 --> 18:06.350
When the major construction starts,

18:07.310 --> 18:08.310
I'll take you both

18:08.440 --> 18:09.760
to Nantong for a trip.

18:10.110 --> 18:11.440
We'll also visit nearby places

18:11.440 --> 18:12.110
like Zhenjiang

18:12.110 --> 18:13.160
and Jinshan Temple.

18:13.160 --> 18:14.360
Don't worry, Mother.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.800
You want to go on a trip that much?

18:31.830 --> 18:33.560
I came all the way here with you—

18:33.750 --> 18:35.830
was it just to sit in a different place?

18:35.830 --> 18:36.690
Sorry for that.

18:37.070 --> 18:37.670
Pingyuan.

18:38.000 --> 18:39.530
Mr. Su from Nantong is here.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.200
Mr. Su.

18:42.310 --> 18:44.440
-I pay my respects to you, Mr. Gu.
-Mr. Su! Mr. Su.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.240
Please get up.

18:45.550 --> 18:47.200
If there's anything, you could have
just sent someone to inform me.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.000
Why did you come

18:48.000 --> 18:48.880
all this way in person?

18:48.880 --> 18:50.110
This is only right.

18:50.240 --> 18:51.100
Well, Pingwen,

18:51.400 --> 18:53.200
hurry and clean up these dishes.

18:54.200 --> 18:55.000
Make some good tea

18:55.000 --> 18:56.160
and prepare some fruit

18:56.160 --> 18:57.070
for Mr. Su.

18:58.590 --> 18:59.280
Mr. Su,

18:59.310 --> 19:00.510
please wait a second.

19:00.510 --> 19:01.640
I'll go get changed.

19:12.800 --> 19:13.440
Mr. Su.

19:14.590 --> 19:15.160
Apples.

19:16.230 --> 19:16.640
Tea.

19:16.640 --> 19:17.550
Thank you.

19:19.270 --> 19:20.200
I'll put it here.

19:23.400 --> 19:24.460
Please have a rest.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.500
Let me help you.

19:50.240 --> 19:50.840
Pingyuan.

19:51.940 --> 19:53.340
Six apples,

19:53.750 --> 19:54.920
eaten in one go.

19:56.960 --> 19:58.290
Go get some more snacks.

20:07.400 --> 20:08.200
Sorry to keep you waiting,

20:08.200 --> 20:08.830
Mr. Su.

20:12.880 --> 20:14.680
I've traveled hundreds of miles

20:15.030 --> 20:16.490
and am utterly exhausted.

20:18.720 --> 20:19.880
Please forgive me, Sir.

20:19.880 --> 20:20.750
Please don't call me that.

20:20.750 --> 20:22.410
I don't deserve such respect.

20:22.510 --> 20:24.110
But it's not that far

20:24.310 --> 20:25.510
from Nantong to Jiangning.

20:25.510 --> 20:28.110
How could you have traveled
hundreds of miles?

20:28.110 --> 20:30.640
I've been running around
borrowing grain everywhere.

20:30.640 --> 20:32.680
This year, life in Nantong

20:33.640 --> 20:36.030
has truly become unbearable.

20:36.830 --> 20:37.630
I understand.

20:38.240 --> 20:40.510
This year has indeed been
full of disasters.

20:40.510 --> 20:41.720
But since I've agreed

20:41.720 --> 20:43.070
to repair the coastal embankment,

20:43.070 --> 20:44.590
I'll definitely provide Nantong

20:44.590 --> 20:45.920
with a proper solution.

20:46.350 --> 20:48.080
Pardon me for my incompetence,

20:48.510 --> 20:50.910
but there's one matter
I can only ask of you.

20:51.880 --> 20:52.880
Please, sit down.

20:53.750 --> 20:55.550
Sorry for embarrassing myself.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.590
The reason I came here

21:00.000 --> 21:02.150
is mainly to ask you, Mr. Gu,

21:03.750 --> 21:05.440
to submit a petition for me.

21:07.310 --> 21:09.440
Nantong has always been prosperous
since ancient times.

21:09.440 --> 21:11.500
If not for this flood

21:11.790 --> 21:13.440
and the collapsed coastal embankment,

21:13.440 --> 21:15.550
we wouldn't be suffering like this.

21:17.510 --> 21:19.110
Many people in Nantong

21:19.130 --> 21:21.260
have started selling their children.

21:23.960 --> 21:24.760
I understand.

21:25.350 --> 21:26.480
So Mr. Su, what do you

21:26.510 --> 21:28.170
specifically plan to do next?

21:28.240 --> 21:29.370
Right now,

21:29.400 --> 21:31.060
in this small city of Nantong,

21:31.070 --> 21:34.000
grain merchants from 5 provinces
have all gathered,

21:34.110 --> 21:35.960
and the rice price is extremely high.

21:35.960 --> 21:36.880
What I'm thinking is that

21:36.880 --> 21:39.280
I hope the Viceroy
can send some troops here

21:40.160 --> 21:41.590
to post a notice,

21:42.400 --> 21:45.130
prohibiting the merchants from
hoarding grain.

21:46.240 --> 21:47.000
Mr. Su,

21:47.270 --> 21:48.400
I'm not an official.

21:49.270 --> 21:50.750
But when it comes to business,

21:50.750 --> 21:52.000
I'm not totally an amateur.

21:52.000 --> 21:53.670
You want the Viceroy

21:53.750 --> 21:55.160
to send troops to post a notice.

21:55.160 --> 21:55.960
For one thing,

21:56.160 --> 21:57.760
the Viceroy might not agree;

21:58.550 --> 21:59.280
for another,

21:59.350 --> 22:00.200
those rice merchants

22:00.200 --> 22:01.800
might just pack up and leave.

22:02.110 --> 22:03.440
The rice belongs to them,

22:03.440 --> 22:04.400
so they can set the price

22:04.400 --> 22:05.440
however they like.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.900
We have no control over it.

22:08.520 --> 22:10.240
I'm about to be

22:10.270 --> 22:12.070
driven to death by those people.

22:12.240 --> 22:13.440
Those rice merchants

22:13.880 --> 22:16.450
are all extremely wealthy.

22:16.550 --> 22:18.160
As a mere county magistrate,

22:18.750 --> 22:20.810
I really can't afford to offend them.

22:21.720 --> 22:22.980
How about this, Mr. Su?

22:23.000 --> 22:24.070
Stay here

22:24.130 --> 22:24.930
for the night.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.510
First thing tomorrow morning,

22:26.510 --> 22:28.640
I'll go deliver this petition for you.

22:29.030 --> 22:30.680
And I'll talk to those grain merchants

22:30.680 --> 22:32.310
from the 5 provinces while I'm at it.

22:32.310 --> 22:32.880
Okay.

22:34.070 --> 22:34.790
Pingwen.

22:34.820 --> 22:36.020
Are the snacks ready?

22:36.720 --> 22:38.020
Yes, Gu.

22:38.160 --> 22:39.960
I've made a pot of plain noodles,

22:39.960 --> 22:41.220
sliced two cucumbers,

22:41.270 --> 22:42.800
and shredded a salted duck.

22:42.880 --> 22:43.750
I wonder if this suits

22:43.750 --> 22:44.790
your taste, Mr. Su?

22:44.790 --> 22:46.210
O-Of course.

22:46.240 --> 22:46.960
It suits perfectly.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.620
Mr. Su.

22:47.790 --> 22:48.280
Please.

22:48.310 --> 22:48.790
Okay.

22:49.830 --> 22:52.230
One really can't go without eating, right?

22:52.350 --> 22:53.090
Indeed.

23:07.720 --> 23:10.100
I heard the people in Nantong

23:10.200 --> 23:11.890
have started selling their children?

23:11.890 --> 23:12.510
Yes.

23:15.750 --> 23:16.280
Let's go.

23:16.510 --> 23:17.310
Take me there.

23:17.800 --> 23:18.330
For what?

23:18.790 --> 23:20.480
You want to draw your sword
and kill some of them?

23:20.480 --> 23:22.440
So you won't do anything about
those people?

23:22.440 --> 23:23.840
What a corrupt official.

23:24.030 --> 23:25.640
Could you not scold me right away?

23:25.640 --> 23:26.830
I'm not even an official—

23:26.830 --> 23:27.920
how could I be a corrupt one?

23:27.920 --> 23:29.780
If you're not a corrupt official,

23:30.070 --> 23:31.360
then you're a profiteer.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.150
If you want to talk about profiteers,

23:32.150 --> 23:33.720
those bastards are the real profiteers.

23:33.720 --> 23:34.830
They know clearly
that the people in Nantong

23:34.830 --> 23:35.750
are starving to death,

23:35.750 --> 23:37.200
yet they're still hoarding goods there

23:37.200 --> 23:38.600
without any compassion.

23:44.510 --> 23:45.440
Tonight,

23:45.830 --> 23:47.490
let me, the corrupt official,

23:48.030 --> 23:49.380
think about

23:49.510 --> 23:51.910
how to punish those profiteers carefully.

23:54.830 --> 23:55.560
I'm so tired.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.300
Take a look at this.

24:14.160 --> 24:14.920
To be fair,

24:14.960 --> 24:17.150
this Su Yuhua is a good official.

24:17.310 --> 24:18.680
He's an old provincial candidate.

24:18.680 --> 24:19.590
After all these years,

24:19.590 --> 24:20.920
he's only managed to
become a county magistrate.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.030
After more than a decade in office,

24:22.030 --> 24:23.440
all he has is this official robe.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.680
He can't afford to give bribes,

24:24.680 --> 24:25.790
so he can't get promoted.

24:25.790 --> 24:28.030
He treats the common people well though.

24:28.030 --> 24:29.840
I don't want to contradict him,

24:29.870 --> 24:32.000
but what nonsense is he talking about?

24:32.030 --> 24:34.310
He wants me to send troops
to suppress the rice market?

24:34.310 --> 24:35.400
Does that even make sense?

24:35.400 --> 24:36.720
If they don't want to sell,

24:36.720 --> 24:37.720
you might enter through the front door,

24:37.720 --> 24:38.920
and they'd slip out the back.

24:38.920 --> 24:41.240
What charge am I supposed to
bring against them?

24:41.240 --> 24:42.550
If you don't take care of

24:42.550 --> 24:43.680
Mr. Su's matter,

24:44.270 --> 24:45.160
then there's no point

24:45.160 --> 24:47.550
in repairing
Nantong's coastal embankment anymore.

24:47.550 --> 24:48.790
What kind of talk is that?

24:48.790 --> 24:49.590
Repairing this coastal embankment

24:49.590 --> 24:51.550
is meant to save the people from disaster.

24:51.550 --> 24:53.440
People in Nantong are already
trading their children for food.

24:53.440 --> 24:54.480
If you don't help them,

24:54.480 --> 24:55.640
by the time the coastal embankment
is repaired,

24:55.640 --> 24:57.030
everyone will already be dead.

24:57.030 --> 24:59.160
What's the point of repairing it then?

25:00.750 --> 25:01.400
Indeed.

25:01.430 --> 25:02.310
You have a point.

25:02.310 --> 25:02.880
But

25:03.070 --> 25:04.730
I really don't have any money.

25:05.030 --> 25:05.550
I...

25:08.260 --> 25:10.390
Could you two please...

25:10.410 --> 25:11.010
Just...

25:20.150 --> 25:20.700
Fine.

25:20.750 --> 25:22.150
Go ahead and tell Su Yuhua

25:22.240 --> 25:23.480
there's nothing I can do.

25:23.480 --> 25:24.180
Sir. Sir.

25:24.470 --> 25:26.590
You really can't say
there's nothing you can do.

25:26.590 --> 25:28.030
Now that we're repairing
the coastal embankment here,

25:28.030 --> 25:29.270
if the rice price is stabilized,

25:29.270 --> 25:30.590
then when the wealthy households return,

25:30.590 --> 25:32.110
the common people will naturally return
as well.

25:32.110 --> 25:33.680
Only after you've settled this matter

25:33.680 --> 25:35.160
can we better gather the manpower,

25:35.160 --> 25:35.590
right?

25:35.720 --> 25:37.330
You want to gather manpower?

25:37.360 --> 25:40.090
Everyone from everywhere
is asking me for money.

25:40.350 --> 25:41.920
I know the people of Nantong
are suffering,

25:41.920 --> 25:43.070
but aren't those in Jinling

25:43.070 --> 25:44.930
and Zhenjiang suffering as well?

25:55.350 --> 25:58.810
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

26:07.160 --> 26:08.290
His Excellency said

26:08.430 --> 26:10.270
he'll come up with a solution soon.

26:10.270 --> 26:11.400
He wants you to go back first

26:11.400 --> 26:12.660
and pacify the people.

26:13.720 --> 26:14.160
So

26:14.680 --> 26:15.590
His Excellency

26:16.160 --> 26:18.090
personally reviewed my petition?

26:18.270 --> 26:18.920
Great.

26:19.790 --> 26:20.920
That's truly great.

26:21.070 --> 26:22.530
I'll head back right away.

26:23.900 --> 26:29.930
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

26:31.830 --> 26:34.030
Those rice merchants are too ruthless.

26:34.510 --> 26:35.510
If all else fails,

26:35.550 --> 26:37.550
we could each contribute some money

26:37.720 --> 26:39.680
to buy the rice
and help the people in Nantong.

26:39.680 --> 26:41.240
Buying the rice is easy enough,

26:41.240 --> 26:42.170
but for how long?

26:42.590 --> 26:43.520
Until next year?

26:44.400 --> 26:45.660
You expect the two of us

26:45.750 --> 26:47.160
to support all the people of Nantong?

26:47.160 --> 26:49.070
How rich would you have to be to do that?

26:49.070 --> 26:49.790
Indeed.

26:50.640 --> 26:51.900
What should we do then?

26:52.920 --> 26:54.920
With just one trick of hoarding goods,

26:54.920 --> 26:56.390
they think they can swallow us whole—

26:56.390 --> 26:58.250
they're thinking way too simply.

26:58.310 --> 26:59.400
I have an idea

27:00.110 --> 27:01.400
that guarantees victory,

27:01.400 --> 27:02.230
but it requires

27:02.230 --> 27:03.890
the two of us to work together.

27:05.650 --> 27:07.170
What, can you do magic

27:07.200 --> 27:08.750
and make rice appear out of thin air?

27:08.750 --> 27:09.310
Look.

27:12.480 --> 27:14.240
Using nothing against nothing.

27:14.240 --> 27:16.070
Everyone can perform tricks,

27:16.400 --> 27:17.460
but the cleverness

27:17.590 --> 27:18.920
lies in how they differ.

27:19.470 --> 27:21.710
[Nantong Prefecture]

27:49.200 --> 27:51.240
Sir, please give me some food

27:51.310 --> 27:53.420
and some money.

27:53.590 --> 27:54.160
Alright.

27:56.720 --> 27:57.240
Here.

27:57.830 --> 27:59.160
I want a big one.

27:59.750 --> 28:00.310
Go now.

28:00.590 --> 28:02.190
-Thank you, Sir.
-Thank you.

28:12.200 --> 28:14.400
I really can't bear to watch this anymore.

28:14.400 --> 28:15.830
Even if you gave them all your money now,

28:15.830 --> 28:17.030
it would be useless.

28:17.690 --> 28:19.480
We need to lower the rice price first,

28:19.480 --> 28:21.610
then we can restore peace to this area.

28:22.480 --> 28:23.740
Those profiteers deserve to die!

28:23.740 --> 28:24.600
Indeed they do.

28:40.240 --> 28:43.740
[Yang Ten-Million, Rice Merchant]

28:57.110 --> 28:58.720
I am Gu Pingyuan.

29:00.160 --> 29:00.790
I am Li Qin.

29:01.160 --> 29:03.220
We've come to pay our respects to you.

29:04.830 --> 29:06.490
So it's you two young masters.

29:07.640 --> 29:08.440
One is an exile

29:08.750 --> 29:10.640
who escaped from death row;

29:11.720 --> 29:12.580
and the other is

29:13.830 --> 29:16.200
the prodigal son of Li Million.

29:16.440 --> 29:17.880
Who are you calling a prodigal son?

29:17.880 --> 29:18.810
That would be us.

29:20.680 --> 29:22.160
May I ask your name,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.200
respected elder?

29:25.070 --> 29:26.130
My surname is Yang.

29:26.640 --> 29:28.720
People call me Yang Ten-Million.

29:28.960 --> 29:30.070
Just several millions more

29:30.070 --> 29:31.730
than your father, that's all.

29:31.960 --> 29:33.020
Yang Ten-Million.

29:33.750 --> 29:35.410
You're a veteran in business.

29:35.480 --> 29:36.440
We respect you.

29:37.110 --> 29:38.510
We hope you'll show mercy

29:38.750 --> 29:40.030
and spare Nantong,

29:40.720 --> 29:42.320
lowering the rice price a bit

29:42.720 --> 29:44.550
so the two of us can get our work done.

29:44.550 --> 29:46.400
You two young heroes.

29:46.720 --> 29:49.480
I can sell my own rice
at whatever price I want.

29:49.640 --> 29:50.830
It's not up to the two of you

29:50.830 --> 29:52.490
to set the price for me, right?

29:52.680 --> 29:53.680
Even the Viceroy of Liangjiang

29:53.680 --> 29:55.610
has no authority over this matter.

29:56.070 --> 29:57.600
You're quite unscrupulous

29:57.960 --> 30:00.310
in doing business, I must say.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.370
Who do you think you're talking to?

30:03.720 --> 30:05.450
I know you're from the capital,

30:05.640 --> 30:07.400
so what? Think you're special?

30:08.680 --> 30:10.740
Want to compete with me financially?

30:15.590 --> 30:16.520
Bring it on then.

30:17.000 --> 30:18.920
However much rice you have  here
in your warehouse,

30:18.920 --> 30:19.880
I'll buy it all.

30:20.590 --> 30:21.720
What's the big deal?

30:26.790 --> 30:28.470
In this warehouse?

30:28.550 --> 30:30.510
Well, I have rice merchants
from 5 provinces

30:30.510 --> 30:31.510
under my control.

30:32.030 --> 30:33.830
I make the call on everything.

30:35.350 --> 30:37.030
Do you think you can buy it all?

30:39.480 --> 30:41.740
In this world, as long as there's a price,

30:41.790 --> 30:43.390
there will always be buyers.

30:43.960 --> 30:44.720
Well then.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.490
I'll wait for you to buy.

30:47.750 --> 30:48.880
How about it, buddy?

30:48.880 --> 30:49.750
Want to challenge me

30:49.750 --> 30:50.590
like he does?

30:50.830 --> 30:51.690
I have no money.

30:52.270 --> 30:53.920
How could I afford to buy anything?

30:53.920 --> 30:55.200
I'll just say one thing.

30:55.200 --> 30:56.220
We're repairing the coastal embankment now

30:56.220 --> 30:57.280
and need manpower.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.110
If you don't lower your rice price,

30:59.110 --> 31:00.350
you're our enemy.

31:01.160 --> 31:03.160
Then don't blame us if we offend you.

31:03.590 --> 31:04.350
Offend me?

31:05.830 --> 31:08.160
I'm not even afraid of the official power.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.400
Do you know who's backing me?

31:10.830 --> 31:12.440
His Highness, Prince Chun.

31:15.420 --> 31:18.590
Who cares about competing with you
based on connections?

31:18.590 --> 31:19.240
Mr. Yang.

31:19.790 --> 31:21.190
Dare to make a bet with us?

31:21.270 --> 31:21.930
Bet on what?

31:21.960 --> 31:23.350
That the rice price will definitely drop

31:23.350 --> 31:24.310
within 10 days.

31:25.030 --> 31:26.360
Not only will they drop,

31:26.440 --> 31:28.360
but they'll drop drastically.

31:37.270 --> 31:37.800
Alright.

31:40.720 --> 31:41.440
Alright.

31:43.310 --> 31:45.970
As long as I don't lower the price
within 10 days,

31:46.000 --> 31:47.400
you two lose, right?

31:47.750 --> 31:48.550
That's right.

31:50.920 --> 31:52.250
How much are we betting?

31:56.270 --> 31:57.270
This is the stake.

31:58.070 --> 32:00.310
The great freshwater pearl tribute
from Joseon.

32:00.310 --> 32:01.790
There are only two in existence.

32:01.790 --> 32:02.480
The other one

32:02.480 --> 32:04.590
is on the Empress Dowager's headdress.

32:04.590 --> 32:06.040
This pearl glows at night

32:06.160 --> 32:07.590
and can repel water.

32:07.880 --> 32:08.610
Appraise it—

32:09.070 --> 32:11.800
do you think it's worth
2 million taels of silver?

32:27.880 --> 32:33.690
[Xuchangyuan]

32:29.590 --> 32:31.050
How was my acting just now?

32:32.400 --> 32:33.130
Pretty good.

32:33.200 --> 32:34.240
As long as it fooled him, that's enough.

32:33.690 --> 32:39.470
[Baixiang Restaurant]

32:35.920 --> 32:37.400
This Yang Ten-Million, I'm telling you,

32:37.400 --> 32:38.440
is really infuriating.

32:38.440 --> 32:39.920
We treated him like a senior,

32:39.920 --> 32:41.650
yet he wouldn't appreciate it.

32:42.160 --> 32:43.200
I never feel any burden about

32:43.200 --> 32:45.200
taking money from someone like him.

32:45.590 --> 32:46.440
When dealing with him,

32:46.440 --> 32:48.590
you have to strip him clean
down to the last hair.

32:48.590 --> 32:49.590
What's your plan?

32:50.110 --> 32:52.110
How much do you plan to make from him?

32:52.270 --> 32:54.000
As much as possible, of course.

32:54.480 --> 32:55.070
I'm thinking,

32:55.070 --> 32:56.350
since his name is Yang Ten-Million,

32:56.350 --> 32:58.080
let's make 10 million from him.

32:58.590 --> 33:00.030
I'll go to Jinling to buy rice first.

33:00.030 --> 33:01.720
And you'll go to Hunan, Hubei, and Anhui,

33:01.720 --> 33:03.590
making a trip around the whole area.

33:03.590 --> 33:05.480
Flaunt yourself in public every day,

33:05.480 --> 33:07.440
saying that rice in Nantong is expensive,

33:07.440 --> 33:08.900
and you, Li Million's son,

33:08.920 --> 33:10.350
have been sent
by the Viceroy of Liangjiang

33:10.350 --> 33:11.280
to collect rice.

33:12.240 --> 33:12.720
But

33:13.000 --> 33:14.400
don't buy a single grain.

33:14.960 --> 33:15.550
How much money

33:15.550 --> 33:16.400
can you put together right now?

33:16.400 --> 33:17.600
Let's pool our money.

33:17.830 --> 33:20.070
About a million taels.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.000
Is that enough?

33:21.000 --> 33:21.860
That's enough.

33:22.920 --> 33:23.830
This pearl

33:23.960 --> 33:24.850
belongs to

33:24.960 --> 33:26.490
Li Million's prodigal son.

33:26.640 --> 33:28.110
He made a bet with me

33:28.790 --> 33:30.030
that within 10 days,

33:30.070 --> 33:32.200
the rice price would definitely drop.

33:32.270 --> 33:33.880
This was his stake.

33:34.510 --> 33:36.120
As long as

33:36.160 --> 33:37.400
we don't sell even a single dan of rice,

33:37.400 --> 33:39.330
how could the price possibly drop?

33:40.760 --> 33:41.890
Within 10 days,

33:43.440 --> 33:44.680
if even a single grain of rice

33:44.680 --> 33:45.830
appears in Nantong,

33:46.310 --> 33:48.030
we'll buy it all up.

33:48.750 --> 33:51.300
Let's see how he'll force us
to lower the price.

33:51.300 --> 33:52.500
That's what we'll do.

33:52.720 --> 33:55.100
We'll let all merchants in the world

33:55.400 --> 33:56.770
know that Li Million

33:56.830 --> 33:58.340
was defeated in Nantong,

33:58.440 --> 33:59.690
defeated by me,

33:59.750 --> 34:01.750
defeated by all of us!

34:10.070 --> 34:11.150
Mr. Chang,

34:11.960 --> 34:13.489
once you dress up like this,

34:13.590 --> 34:14.790
you look exactly like

34:15.190 --> 34:16.050
a big merchant.

34:17.960 --> 34:18.690
Does it work?

34:18.739 --> 34:19.230
Yes.

34:20.000 --> 34:20.590
That's not right.

34:20.590 --> 34:22.190
There should be glasses too.

34:22.550 --> 34:23.679
Right, glasses too.

34:23.880 --> 34:24.320
Here.

34:32.230 --> 34:32.710
Nice.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.270
I'm Chang Si,

34:37.880 --> 34:39.000
from Shanxi.

34:39.170 --> 34:42.190
I've been in the rice and flour business
in Guangdong and Guangxi for years.

34:42.190 --> 34:44.980
I'm grateful to you for all your support
over the years.

34:44.980 --> 34:46.510
As this is my first time
visiting your esteemed place,

34:46.510 --> 34:48.000
I hope I haven't caused too much trouble.

34:48.000 --> 34:48.920
Much obliged.

34:49.550 --> 34:50.230
Mr. Chang,

34:50.280 --> 34:51.940
as expected from an old hand.

34:52.110 --> 34:53.110
You look the part perfectly.

34:53.110 --> 34:54.850
Well, you haven't seen me yet.

34:55.110 --> 34:56.650
Mr. Liao, don't rush.

34:56.960 --> 34:58.630
After Mr. Chang finishes his show
tomorrow,

34:58.630 --> 35:00.690
it will be your turn to take the stage.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.150
-Be careful.
-Ladies and gentlemen,

35:02.150 --> 35:02.980
watch me.

35:04.360 --> 35:05.000
This plaster

35:05.000 --> 35:06.150
wasn't my idea.

35:09.760 --> 35:10.510
Pingwen.

35:10.710 --> 35:12.400
What's this about?

35:12.590 --> 35:14.020
I'm your henchman,

35:14.150 --> 35:16.060
serving as your butler.

35:19.150 --> 35:19.590
Alright, alright.

35:19.590 --> 35:19.960
That's enough.

35:19.960 --> 35:20.760
Get up. Get up.

35:21.320 --> 35:22.380
It's getting late.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.600
Let's all rest early.

35:24.030 --> 35:24.800
Tomorrow morning,

35:24.800 --> 35:26.190
we'll proceed as planned.

35:26.190 --> 35:27.400
Mr. Chang, remember this:

35:27.400 --> 35:28.360
tomorrow, you'll be allocated

35:28.360 --> 35:29.490
200,000 dan of rice,

35:29.710 --> 35:30.840
at 3 taels of silver per dan.

35:30.840 --> 35:31.360
Remember,

35:31.360 --> 35:31.960
cash only.

35:32.230 --> 35:32.960
Absolutely don't sell

35:32.960 --> 35:34.070
at the price lower than 3 taels per dan.

35:34.070 --> 35:34.730
No problem.

35:35.550 --> 35:40.100
[Nantong]

35:59.480 --> 35:59.880
Sir.

36:00.880 --> 36:02.210
I was meaning to ask you.

36:02.480 --> 36:04.110
About the coastal embankment
repairs in Nantong,

36:04.110 --> 36:05.690
why haven't you made any arrangements
for it?

36:05.690 --> 36:07.360
I need to lower the rice price first.

36:07.360 --> 36:08.480
This is also helping you, Sir,

36:08.480 --> 36:10.080
to enhance your reputation.

36:10.670 --> 36:12.000
Yes, of course.

36:12.190 --> 36:12.550
By the way,

36:12.550 --> 36:13.620
I've heard that

36:13.710 --> 36:15.510
Li Qin has already gone to
the Hunan and Hubei area,

36:15.510 --> 36:17.480
and you've been buying rice

36:17.510 --> 36:18.860
like crazy in Jinling.

36:20.280 --> 36:22.140
I truly appreciate your efforts,

36:22.840 --> 36:24.730
spending your own money

36:24.840 --> 36:27.170
to handle matters for the imperial court.

36:27.820 --> 36:30.150
But there's one thing I don't understand:

36:30.150 --> 36:32.280
how much money do you two actually have

36:32.670 --> 36:34.710
to save the people of Nantong?

36:35.590 --> 36:37.440
A bit over a million taels, I suppose.

36:37.440 --> 36:38.510
That's nowhere near enough.

36:38.510 --> 36:39.110
Not enough?

36:39.110 --> 36:40.070
Then why don't you open the granaries

36:40.070 --> 36:41.730
and distribute relief grain?

36:41.920 --> 36:43.120
I don't have any rice.

36:43.390 --> 36:44.590
I have no grain at all.

36:46.590 --> 36:48.510
I've worked out a strategy with Li Qin

36:48.510 --> 36:50.400
that can bring the rice price back down.

36:50.400 --> 36:51.880
We won't need to spend
a single penny ourselves.

36:51.880 --> 36:52.590
And meanwhile,

36:52.590 --> 36:53.990
we can even make a profit.

36:55.510 --> 36:56.840
What do you mean by that?

37:04.710 --> 37:05.630
Wonderful.

37:06.550 --> 37:07.950
That's truly wonderful.

37:11.070 --> 37:12.320
Come on.

37:20.800 --> 37:21.230
Look.

37:21.280 --> 37:23.270
I don't have much money.

37:23.440 --> 37:25.570
This is my salary from all these years,

37:25.590 --> 37:27.440
20,000 taels in total.

37:29.470 --> 37:30.260
Sir,

37:30.760 --> 37:31.690
I never expected

37:31.710 --> 37:33.310
you'd offer all your salary.

37:34.060 --> 37:35.070
Please rest assured.

37:35.070 --> 37:35.670
Regarding the rice price,

37:35.670 --> 37:36.710
I will handle it properly.

37:36.710 --> 37:37.320
This money,

37:37.320 --> 37:39.650
I'll make sure it's spent where it counts.

37:40.550 --> 37:42.690
You think I'm making a donation?

37:43.190 --> 37:44.320
No way.

37:45.440 --> 37:47.310
Count me in as a shareholder.

37:47.630 --> 37:49.290
I want to make some profit too.

37:49.840 --> 37:51.280
The sage once said,

37:51.590 --> 37:53.190
if you don't take advantage when you can,

37:53.190 --> 37:54.190
you're a fool.

37:58.480 --> 37:59.970
The sage is truly

38:00.230 --> 38:00.890
brilliant.

38:17.880 --> 38:19.280
The show is already over,

38:19.320 --> 38:20.010
yet

38:20.110 --> 38:21.640
he's still putting on airs.

38:23.590 --> 38:24.190
Mr. Chang.

38:24.190 --> 38:24.960
Please sit down.

38:24.960 --> 38:26.220
I'll get you some rice.

38:27.880 --> 38:28.880
Where's Pingwen?

38:29.440 --> 38:30.570
I'm here, Mr. Chang.

38:31.190 --> 38:32.100
The two of us

38:32.190 --> 38:33.650
came all the way here,

38:33.710 --> 38:35.400
haven't even settled down yet,

38:35.400 --> 38:36.800
and now we have to go back.

38:37.000 --> 38:38.400
Isn't this Yang Ten-Million

38:38.400 --> 38:40.020
going too far?

38:40.190 --> 38:41.450
That's exactly right.

38:41.590 --> 38:43.440
With all the expenses for food and lodging
on the road,

38:43.440 --> 38:45.230
if they offer lower than 3 taels,

38:45.230 --> 38:46.190
even a penny less,

38:46.190 --> 38:47.480
we can't sell it.

38:47.810 --> 38:49.010
That's settled then.

38:49.150 --> 38:49.840
As the old saying goes,

38:49.840 --> 38:51.630
"if you can't play the part well,
better not to play it at all."

38:51.630 --> 38:52.110
Mr. Chang.

38:52.110 --> 38:53.030
You were amazing.

38:53.030 --> 38:54.110
Master Gu, was it good?

38:54.110 --> 38:55.110
It was excellent.

38:55.230 --> 38:56.070
I'm exhausted.

38:56.070 --> 38:56.670
Pingyuan,

38:57.000 --> 38:58.230
why aren't you praising me?

38:58.230 --> 39:00.080
You didn't even act.
Why should I praise you?

39:00.080 --> 39:01.190
Alright, alright, good job.

39:01.190 --> 39:01.790
Let's eat.

39:02.590 --> 39:03.280
Everyone.

39:03.670 --> 39:05.430
Today, with just a small trick,

39:05.480 --> 39:06.280
we've earned

39:06.320 --> 39:07.440
600,000 taels of silver.

39:07.440 --> 39:08.800
Weren't you supposed to be
saving the people?

39:08.800 --> 39:10.530
How did you end up making money?

39:10.630 --> 39:11.840
That Yang Ten-Million

39:11.840 --> 39:13.510
feeds on human flesh
and drinks human blood.

39:13.510 --> 39:14.400
He bought up all the rice

39:14.400 --> 39:15.110
in Nantong,

39:15.550 --> 39:16.360
thinking

39:16.360 --> 39:17.290
he's so capable.

39:17.440 --> 39:18.100
Mr. Liao,

39:18.150 --> 39:19.280
it's your turn now.

39:19.630 --> 39:20.670
Q-Quickly, give me

39:20.670 --> 39:21.470
your costume.

39:21.480 --> 39:22.000
No need.

39:22.280 --> 39:23.320
I had one made

39:23.360 --> 39:24.320
specially for your size.

39:24.320 --> 39:25.190
Once you put it on,

39:25.190 --> 39:27.320
you'll look even more impressive
than Mr. Chang.

39:27.320 --> 39:27.920
This time,

39:27.920 --> 39:29.630
we need to make two more shipments.

39:29.630 --> 39:31.760
Tomorrow, I'll allocate 600,000 dan
to you;

39:31.760 --> 39:33.670
and the day after, a million dan.

39:33.760 --> 39:34.410
Remember:

39:34.630 --> 39:36.070
all has to be sold at 3 taels of silver,

39:36.070 --> 39:37.400
not a single penny less.

39:39.430 --> 39:41.990
That Yang Ten-Million isn't a fool.

39:42.230 --> 39:43.160
Can he handle

39:43.230 --> 39:44.360
buying so much rice?

39:44.480 --> 39:45.400
He may not be a fool,

39:45.400 --> 39:46.720
but he's too greedy.

39:46.960 --> 39:48.400
However much I feed him now,

39:48.400 --> 39:49.920
he'll have to swallow it all.

39:49.920 --> 39:51.650
I'll stuff him until he bursts.

39:52.960 --> 39:54.970
I have a few friends

39:55.070 --> 39:56.730
in the rice business in Anhui.

39:57.030 --> 39:58.030
They can pool

39:58.480 --> 39:59.740
another 2 million dan.

39:59.880 --> 40:00.540
Excellent.

40:00.630 --> 40:01.990
Then I won't trouble another person
for this matter.

40:01.990 --> 40:02.760
From acting to pooling grain,

40:02.760 --> 40:03.760
you handle it all.

40:04.850 --> 40:05.710
Here's what I thought:

40:05.710 --> 40:06.760
after we get this done,

40:06.760 --> 40:08.800
I want to set aside
500,000 taels of silver

40:08.800 --> 40:10.880
to buy jewelry for Miss Liao.

40:11.230 --> 40:12.470
What do you think?

40:13.320 --> 40:14.780
F-Five hundred thousand?

40:18.440 --> 40:19.440
That's generous,

40:19.800 --> 40:21.890
but with Mr. Chang here,

40:22.150 --> 40:23.670
taking so much money

40:24.550 --> 40:25.780
makes me a bit uncomfortable.

40:25.780 --> 40:26.480
Then let's make it less.

40:26.480 --> 40:27.080
No, no, no.

40:27.110 --> 40:28.170
It's settled then.

40:29.190 --> 40:31.030
You're selling much more than me,

40:31.030 --> 40:33.090
so you should act more convincingly.

40:33.800 --> 40:34.580
Today,

40:34.630 --> 40:36.160
I finally got to see

40:36.190 --> 40:37.150
how despicable Yang Ten-Million was.

40:37.150 --> 40:38.630
If you didn't need to keep up this act,

40:38.630 --> 40:41.030
I would've smashed his nose
with one punch.

40:41.840 --> 40:42.990
He's just a bad guy,

40:43.030 --> 40:44.160
a complete villain.

40:44.550 --> 40:45.590
After I finish eating,

40:45.590 --> 40:46.590
I'll explain everything to you,

40:46.590 --> 40:48.650
then you'll know how to deal with him.

40:48.880 --> 40:50.390
Please skip the meal

40:50.510 --> 40:51.690
and teach me now.

40:51.850 --> 40:53.590
After you've taught me, then you can eat.

40:53.590 --> 40:54.710
Let's go have a drink.

40:54.710 --> 40:55.400
-Come on.
-Alright, alright.

40:55.400 --> 40:55.930
Let's go.

40:55.960 --> 40:56.710
Come on.

41:08.610 --> 41:09.320
Profiteer?

41:11.320 --> 41:12.120
Time to sleep.

41:13.960 --> 41:14.880
I knew

41:14.960 --> 41:16.160
you'd scold me again.

41:18.220 --> 41:20.180
That you remember quite clearly.

41:20.840 --> 41:22.210
You think I want to keep

41:22.320 --> 41:23.780
all this money for myself?

41:24.190 --> 41:24.840
I just hope

41:24.880 --> 41:25.710
the people of Nantong

41:25.710 --> 41:26.970
can have a better life.

41:27.520 --> 41:28.110
If every

41:28.110 --> 41:29.320
worker repairing the coastal embankment

41:29.320 --> 41:30.550
could earn two more candareens daily

41:30.550 --> 41:31.710
to support their families,

41:31.710 --> 41:33.030
once the rice price stabilizes

41:33.030 --> 41:34.440
and the coastal embankment is repaired,

41:34.440 --> 41:36.370
Nantong will regain its vitality.

41:37.110 --> 41:37.960
As the saying goes,

41:37.960 --> 41:40.230
once you set out to do something,
you must see it through;

41:40.230 --> 41:42.890
and once you get it done,
you must leave a legacy.

41:43.440 --> 41:44.300
Except for you,

41:44.760 --> 41:47.220
I don't want to be criticized
by anyone else.

41:49.480 --> 41:50.880
Well, profiteer, you're

41:51.550 --> 41:53.680
quite the grudge-holder, aren't you?

42:10.030 --> 42:17.400
♪ A single straight purple bamboo ♪

42:17.850 --> 42:23.480
♪ Give the flute made of it to the baby ♪

42:23.710 --> 42:27.150
♪ The flute to the mouth ♪

42:27.590 --> 42:30.840
♪ The mouth to the flute ♪

42:31.480 --> 42:31.800
Master.

42:31.800 --> 42:33.070
♪ A new tune flows from the flute ♪

42:33.070 --> 42:35.070
Another rice merchant
has arrived in Nantong.

42:35.070 --> 42:36.000
He's from Anhui.

42:37.360 --> 42:38.280
Anhui?

42:38.880 --> 42:41.360
Don't cause trouble for me here.

42:41.840 --> 42:43.030
How much rice did he bring?

42:43.030 --> 42:43.800
600,000 dan.

42:44.670 --> 42:45.730
That's quite a lot.

42:46.030 --> 42:46.840
I heard there's

42:46.840 --> 42:48.700
another 2 to 3 million dan coming.

42:51.190 --> 42:52.240
600,000 dan

42:53.630 --> 42:54.320
and another 3 mill...

42:54.320 --> 42:55.360
Are you sure you heard it right?

42:55.360 --> 42:56.130
Absolutely.

42:57.760 --> 42:59.090
So it's 3.6 million dan?

43:00.030 --> 43:00.760
So much rice—

43:01.110 --> 43:02.070
how could the small city of Nantong

43:02.070 --> 43:03.110
possibly consume it all?
